# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up QCSC-Prefect on a Slurm cluster {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"
msgstr "Nastavení QCSC-Prefect na clusteru Slurm {#set-up-qcsc-prefect-on-a-slurm-cluster}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide prepares the login node of a Slurm cluster as the workflow host of qcsc-prefect.\n"
"The qcsc-prefect SQD tutorial starts from the result of this guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento průvodce připraví přihlašovací uzel clusteru Slurm jako hostitele pracovního postupu pro qcsc-prefect.\n"
"Tutoriál qcsc-prefect SQD navazuje na výsledek tohoto průvodce.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you complete this guide, you have the following items:\n"
msgstr "Po dokončení tohoto průvodce budeš mít následující položky:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Where | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Login node, the workflow host | Prefect, the qcsc-prefect packages, and the `qcsc-qrmi` command |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Compute nodes, inside Slurm jobs | The QRMI worker: QRMI with its `task_runner` command, and `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | The block that names your IBM Quantum&reg; instance and QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Login node and compute nodes | Your IBM Cloud&reg; API key, instances, and backends for QRMI |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Položka | Kde | Obsah |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-host` | Přihlašovací uzel, hostitel pracovního postupu | Prefect, balíčky qcsc-prefect a příkaz `qcsc-qrmi` |\n"
"| `~/venv/qcsc-node` | Výpočetní uzly, uvnitř úloh Slurm | Worker QRMI: QRMI s příkazem `task_runner` a `qcsc-prefect-qiskit` |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | Prefect | Blok, který pojmenovává tvou instanci IBM Quantum&reg; a QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi_config.json` | Přihlašovací uzel a výpočetní uzly | Tvůj klíč API IBM Cloud&reg;, instance a backendy pro QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run each command in a terminal on the login node, unless the step says otherwise.\n"
msgstr "Každý příkaz spusť v terminálu na přihlašovacím uzlu, pokud krok neříká jinak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Předpoklady {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A Slurm cluster with OpenMPI, PMIx, and the QRMI SPANK plugin, which the cluster\n"
"administrator installs. The following guides describe these components:\n"
msgstr ""
"Cluster Slurm s OpenMPI, PMIx a pluginem QRMI SPANK, které nainstaluje správce\n"
"clusteru. Tyto komponenty popisují následující průvodci:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"
msgstr "[Quantum resource management interface (QRMI)](/guides/qrmi)\n"

# doq: translated after #1094 review 2026-11-21
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin for QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"
msgstr "[Plugin SPANK pro QRMI](/guides/slurm-plugin)\n"

# doq: translated after #1094 review 2026-11-21
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[SPANK plugin user guide](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"
msgstr "[Uživatelská příručka pluginu SPANK](/guides/slurm-hpc-ux)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A home directory and a work directory that the login node and the compute nodes see at\n"
"the same absolute paths\n"
msgstr ""
"Domovský adresář a pracovní adresář, které přihlašovací uzel i výpočetní uzly vidí na\n"
"stejných absolutních cestách\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS access to GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum, and Prefect Cloud from the login\n"
"node, and to IBM Quantum from the compute nodes\n"
msgstr ""
"Odchozí přístup HTTPS na GitHub, PyPI, IBM Quantum a Prefect Cloud z přihlašovacího\n"
"uzlu a na IBM Quantum z výpočetních uzlů\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum Platform account with an IBM Cloud API key and at least one instance\n"
msgstr "Účet IBM Quantum Platform s klíčem API IBM Cloud a alespoň jednou instancí\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Prefect Cloud account, or a Prefect server that you host\n"
msgstr "Účet Prefect Cloud nebo server Prefect, který hostuješ sám\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Git, C and C++ compilers, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK, and MPI on the cluster, for the solver\n"
"builds of the tutorial\n"
msgstr ""
"Git, kompilátory C a C++, CMake, BLAS, LAPACK a MPI na clusteru pro sestavení řešičů\n"
"v tutoriálu\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The examples use the Slurm partition `normal` and the compute nodes `c1` and `c2`. Replace\n"
"them with the names of your cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"Příklady používají oddíl Slurm `normal` a výpočetní uzly `c1` a `c2`. Nahraď\n"
"je názvy z tvého clusteru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Log in to the login node {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"
msgstr "Krok 1: Přihlas se na přihlašovací uzel {#step-1-log-in-to-the-login-node}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Install uv {#step-2-install-uv}"
msgstr "Krok 2: Nainstaluj uv {#step-2-install-uv}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) package manager, and check the installation:\n"
msgstr "Nainstaluj správce balíčků [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) a zkontroluj instalaci:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Set the paths and create the work directory {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"
msgstr "Krok 3: Nastav cesty a vytvoř pracovní adresář {#step-3-set-the-paths-and-create-the-work-directory}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide and the tutorials use two environment variables:\n"
msgstr "Tento průvodce a tutoriály používají dvě proměnné prostředí:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable | Example | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | The qcsc-prefect checkout |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | The work directory of the solver jobs and the QRMI jobs |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Proměnná | Příklad | Účel |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `QCSC_PREFECT` | `$HOME/qcsc-prefect` | Checkout qcsc-prefect |\n"
"| `QCSC_WORK_DIR` | `/shared/work/qcsc-prefect` | Pracovní adresář úloh solveru a úloh QRMI |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Both paths must be on storage that the compute nodes see at the same absolute path. If\n"
"your cluster has no `/shared` directory, choose another shared path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Obě cesty musí ležet na úložišti, které výpočetní uzly vidí pod stejnou absolutní cestou. Pokud\n"
"tvůj cluster nemá adresář `/shared`, zvol jinou sdílenou cestu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the variables, and create the work directory. Set the variables again in every new\n"
"shell before you follow a tutorial:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nastav proměnné a vytvoř pracovní adresář. Před každým tutoriálem nastav proměnné znovu v každém novém\n"
"shellu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the variables in every new shell automatically, add them to `~/.bashrc`:\n"
msgstr "Aby se proměnné nastavovaly v každém novém shellu automaticky, přidej je do `~/.bashrc`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Clone qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"
msgstr "Krok 4: Naklonuj qcsc-prefect {#step-4-clone-qcsc-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the repository, and check out a release tag, for example `v0.3.1`:\n"
msgstr "Naklonuj repozitář a přepni se na tag vydání, například `v0.3.1`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5: Create the workflow environment {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"
msgstr "Krok 5: Vytvoř prostředí workflow {#step-5-create-the-workflow-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the workflow environment with Python 3.12, and activate it:\n"
msgstr "Vytvoř prostředí workflow s Pythonem 3.12 a aktivuj ho:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the qcsc-prefect packages. The `--no-deps` option keeps the exact version pins\n"
"between the packages of the checkout. The tutorial installs the workflow itself:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nainstaluj balíčky qcsc-prefect. Volba `--no-deps` zachová přesné pevné verze\n"
"mezi balíčky checkoutu. Samotné workflow nainstaluje tutoriál:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the commands are available:\n"
msgstr "Zkontroluj, že jsou příkazy dostupné:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate `~/venv/qcsc-host` in every new shell on the login node.\n"
msgstr "Aktivuj `~/venv/qcsc-host` v každém novém shellu na přihlašovacím uzlu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6: Log in to Prefect {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"
msgstr "Krok 6: Přihlas se k Prefectu {#step-6-log-in-to-prefect}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log in to Prefect Cloud. Choose **Paste an API key**, paste a Prefect Cloud API key, and\n"
"choose your workspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Přihlas se k Prefect Cloud. Zvol **Paste an API key**, vlož API klíč Prefect Cloud a\n"
"zvol svůj workspace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the connection. The output shows `PREFECT_API_URL` and your workspace:\n"
msgstr "Zkontroluj připojení. Výstup ukáže `PREFECT_API_URL` a tvůj workspace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Optional: use your own Prefect server\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Volitelné: použij vlastní server Prefect\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this note if you use Prefect Cloud. To use your own Prefect server instead of Prefect\n"
"Cloud, follow\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/),\n"
"and set the address of your server in place of `<server-host>`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tuto poznámku přeskoč, pokud používáš Prefect Cloud. Pokud chceš místo Prefect\n"
"Cloud použít vlastní server Prefect, postupuj podle\n"
"[How to run and access a Prefect server on a Slurm login node](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_setup_prefect_server_slurm/)\n"
"a zadej adresu svého serveru místo `<server-host>`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 7: Store the IBM Quantum credentials {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"
msgstr "Krok 7: Ulož přihlašovací údaje IBM Quantum {#step-7-store-the-ibm-quantum-credentials}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run `qcsc-qrmi login` after the Prefect login, because it saves the `qrmi-runtime` block:\n"
msgstr "Spusť `qcsc-qrmi login` po přihlášení k Prefectu, protože ukládá blok `qrmi-runtime`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Answer the prompts:\n"
msgstr "Odpověz na výzvy:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paste your IBM Cloud API key. The key is not shown.\n"
msgstr "Vlož svůj API klíč IBM Cloud. Klíč se nezobrazí.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Enter to use all instances.\n"
msgstr "Stiskni Enter, abys použil všechny instance.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the number of the default instance, `1` in the following example.\n"
msgstr "Zadej číslo výchozí instance, v následujícím příkladu `1`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter the number or the name of the default backend, `4` (`ibm_kingston`) in the\n"
"following example.\n"
msgstr "Zadej číslo nebo název výchozího backendu, v následujícím příkladu `4` (`ibm_kingston`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The command also prints a note about the compute nodes and `[qrmi]` lines for\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, which the example omits (`...`). You do not need the `[qrmi]` lines,\n"
"because the workflow reads the instance and the backend from the `qrmi-runtime` block.\n"
msgstr ""
"Příkaz také vypíše poznámku o výpočetních uzlech a řádky `[qrmi]` pro\n"
"`sqd_blocks.toml`, které příklad vynechává (`...`). Řádky `[qrmi]` nepotřebuješ,\n"
"protože workflow čte instanci a backend z bloku `qrmi-runtime`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `qcsc-qrmi` command has the following subcommands:\n"
msgstr "Příkaz `qcsc-qrmi` má následující podpříkazy:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Purpose |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Store the API key, the instances, and the backends, and save the block |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Find the instances and backends again with the stored key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Print the instances and backends, without the key |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Check that the instance of the block can use its backend |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Příkaz | Účel |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi login` | Uloží API klíč, instance a backendy a uloží blok |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi refresh` | Znovu vyhledá instance a backendy pomocí uloženého klíče |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi list` | Vypíše instance a backendy bez klíče |\n"
"| `qcsc-qrmi check` | Zkontroluje, že instance bloku může použít svůj backend |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the file on the compute nodes {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"
msgstr "Nainstaluj soubor na výpočetní uzly {#install-the-file-on-the-compute-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SPANK plugin reads `qrmi_config.json` on each compute node, from the path in\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, often `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Ask your cluster administrator to\n"
"install your `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` at that path. Install it again after each\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` or `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Plugin SPANK čte `qrmi_config.json` na každém výpočetním uzlu z cesty uvedené v\n"
"`plugstack.conf`, často `/etc/slurm/qrmi_config.json`. Požádej správce svého clusteru, aby\n"
"nainstaloval tvůj `~/.qiskit/qrmi_config.json` na tuto cestu. Nainstaluj ho znovu po každém\n"
"`qcsc-qrmi login` nebo `qcsc-qrmi refresh`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keep **Session Mode** of the `qrmi-runtime` block at `batch`, because the SPANK plugin\n"
"acquires the QPU in batch mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ponech **Session Mode** bloku `qrmi-runtime` na hodnotě `batch`, protože plugin SPANK\n"
"získává QPU v režimu batch.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 8: Create the compute-node environment {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"
msgstr "Krok 8: Vytvoř prostředí výpočetního uzlu {#step-8-create-the-compute-node-environment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI worker runs on a compute node, in its own environment. Create it from the same\n"
"checkout. The `--python` option keeps `~/venv/qcsc-host` active:\n"
msgstr ""
"Worker QRMI běží na výpočetním uzlu ve vlastním prostředí. Vytvoř ho ze stejného\n"
"checkoutu. Volba `--python` ponechá aktivní `~/venv/qcsc-host`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qrmi[ibm]` package provides the `task_runner` command. The tutorial adds the SQD\n"
"compilation hook to this environment, and uses `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` as the\n"
"`python_executable` of `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Balíček `qrmi[ibm]` poskytuje příkaz `task_runner`. Tutoriál přidá do tohoto prostředí hook\n"
"kompilace SQD a použije `~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python` jako\n"
"`python_executable` v `sqd_blocks.toml`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 9: Verify the setup {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"
msgstr "Krok 9: Ověř nastavení {#step-9-verify-the-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the `qrmi-runtime` block exists:\n"
msgstr "Zkontroluj, že blok `qrmi-runtime` existuje:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the stored instances and backends. The command never prints the key:\n"
msgstr "Zkontroluj uložené instance a backendy. Příkaz klíč nikdy nevypíše:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that the default instance can use the default backend:\n"
msgstr "Zkontroluj, že výchozí instance může použít výchozí backend:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check that Slurm runs a job on both compute nodes, also with PMIx:\n"
msgstr "Zkontroluj, že Slurm spustí úlohu na obou výpočetních uzlech, také s PMIx:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Check the compute-node environment and the work directory on a compute node. The first\n"
"command prints nothing when the imports succeed:\n"
msgstr ""
"Zkontroluj prostředí výpočetního uzlu a pracovní adresář na výpočetním uzlu. První\n"
"příkaz nevypíše nic, pokud importy uspějí:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Další kroky {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Doporučení\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/)\n"
"to choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přečti si [Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/),\n"
"abys zvolil uzly, ranky a vlákna úloh solveru.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the [SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
"for the configuration file, the solvers, and the run parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přečti si [SQD workflow README](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect/tree/main/algorithms/open_loop/sqd)\n"
"o konfiguračním souboru, solverech a parametrech běhu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read [QRMI sampler on Slurm](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_qrmi_slurm_sampler/)\n"
"for the QRMI worker and the layout of `qrmi_config.json`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přečti si [QRMI sampler on Slurm](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/howto/howto_qrmi_slurm_sampler/)\n"
"o workeru QRMI a struktuře `qrmi_config.json`.\n"
